      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "SUE'S MEMORY (5) goes very well this trip starting seven times for four wins and two minors. Hit the frame latest (23.17) when third at this track in a Grade 4/5. Looks well placed and should feature. MISDIRECTION (1) was strong over this course and distance last time despite filling the minors, finishing 3.5 lengths behind Impress Moana in 22.95 and recording a new PB here. Has the ability and looks a key chance. REBORN DESTINY (2) has some solid form under her belt and proved too classy last time to win by a nose at this track in a handy 22.95 beating Kaelix Comet. Consistent performer from this draw with a win and two minor placings to her credit. One of the leading chances again. PATIENT VICKY (7) missed the placings here last start but is well-placed to turn the form around.",
